ES PROFESSIONAL GOLF ASSOCIATION (LPGA) TOUR."}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-08-25 12:47:00', 'title': 'THE ILLUMINATING COMPANY COMPLETES WORK TO PROTECT YOUNG EAGLES NEAR REDWOOD ELEMENTARY SCHOOL IN AVON LAKE', 'text': 'AVON LAKE, OHIO, AUG. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AS PART OF ITS ONGOING EFFORTS TO PROTECT BIRDS THAT NEST OR PERCH NEAR ENERGIZED ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT,\xa0THE ILLUMINATING COMPANY, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), COMPLETED PROACTIVE WORK ALONG POWER LINES AT REDWOOD ELEMENTARY SCHOOL IN AVON LAKE, OHIO, WHERE YOUNG EAGLES OFTEN REST FOR SHORT PERIODS OF TIME. THE COMPANY INSTALLED A TALL WOODEN EXTENSION ATOP A UTILITY POLE THAT WILL PROVIDE A SAFER PERCHING LOCATION FOR THE BIRDS AWAY FROM ENERGIZED EQUIPMENT.'}{'symbol': 'FTNT', 'date': '2021-08-25 09:00:00', 'title': 'FORTINET AND DRAGOS EXPAND PARTNERSHIP TO FURTHER SECURE OT INFRASTRUCTURE', 'text': "FORTINET'S FORTIGATE AND THE DRAGOS PLATFORM INTEGRATE TO PROVIDE JOINT CUSTOMERS WITH ADVANCED SECURITY AND SIMPLIFIED DEPLOYMENT ACROSS OT ORGANIZATIONS FORTINET'S FORTIGATE AND THE DRAGOS PLATFORM INTEGRATE TO PROVIDE JOINT CUSTOMERS WITH ADVANCED SECURITY AND SIMPLIFIED DEPLOYMENT ACROSS OT ORGANIZATIONS"}{'symbol': 'FBHS', 'date': '2021-08-25 11:00:00', 'title': "FORTUNE BRANDS ACCELERATES ITS GLOBAL EHS AND ESG TRANSFORMATION WITH PROCESSMAP'S SOFTWARE AND DATA ANALYTICS", 'text': "DEERFIELD, ILL. & FT. LAUDERDALE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #DIGITALTRANSFORMATION--FORTUNE BRANDS HOME & SECURITY (FBHS) ACCELERATES ITS GLOBAL EHS AND ESG TRANSFORMATION WITH PROCESSMAP'S SOFTWARE AND DATA ANALYTICS"}{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2021-08-25 07:00:00', 'title': 'MALIBU BOATS SELECTS GARMIN MARINE ELECTRONICS\xa0FOR ITS FULL LINE OF AXIS WAKESURF AND WAKEBOARDING BOATS', 'text': "OLATHE, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GARMIN® INTERNATIONAL, INC., A UNIT OF GARMIN LTD. (NASDAQ:GRMN), THE WORLD'S LARGEST1 AND MOST INNOVATIVE MARINE ELECTRONICS MANUFACTURER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MALIBU BOATS, I